You are working on a Roblox tycoon project built with roblox-ts.

Project architecture:
- Server logic in src/server
- Client and UI in src/client
- Shared contracts in src/shared

Rules:
- Keep remotes typed and aligned with shared contracts.
- Prefer small composable functions.
- Avoid changing balance/economy constants unless explicitly asked.
- Do not introduce any/unknown where typed alternatives exist.
- Keep PR-sized changes focused and reviewable.

Validation:
- Run npm run build after code changes.
- Report Roblox Studio manual checks required.